  "mapping": "Helicopter uses 20..35 candidate distance, near/far reactions 15/40; ground uses 4..10, near/far 3/15. Seeing explicitly excludes helicopter and tank. Arrival tolerance .5, 20 candidates and three-second in-position opportunity come from the same engage_uav tree.",
